  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provincial and Local Governance Support Program (PLGSP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sub-National Governance Programme in a no. of municipalities after implementation of federalism in line with the new constitution. The programme aims is to improve local governance for effective service delivery, local development and citizen empowerment. The PLGSP will contribute to gender equality through implementing targeted activities as well as mainstreaming gender equality in its programming.</narrative>
  </description>
